      "duplicates: 441 links — D1 33, D2 382, D3 26\n",
      "  D1/D2 rows inheriting G1–M3: 464  (cross-batch roots: 11)\n",
      "  D1 cells that differed from their root before inheriting: 57 on 17 patents\n",
      "master: 1799 rows, 1639 patents, primary rows 1335\n"
     ]
