      "  edge tag STOLSimilar     :    2 rows /   2 patents   (wizard alone: 2 rows)\n",
      "  takeoff_final (approved rows): {'VTOL': 1267, 'STOL': 2, 'V/STOL': 1}   is_electric_final: {'Yes': 872, 'Unknown': 167, 'Hybrid': 127, 'No': 104}\n",
