      "  wizard tags removed (identity answer contradicts): []\n",
      "  wizard tags kept by WIZARD_TAG_KEEP: [('US11124286B1', 'UAVSimilar', 'uav_final=No', 'user 2026-09-14: UAV but similar stays, although uav_final=No')]\n"
