     "text": [
      "  per-figure ML: 5753 / 5840 figures matched a feed row (18 ml_ columns)\n",
      "figures: 5840 with a file reference (5825 files present, 1913 approved); 6497 '(fig N)' placeholder blocks dropped (0 approved)\n"
     ]
